<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Ndwewe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongohi</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba ali lingukemwa Yuda, lihina likiyima kwakya lya lihamba ali. Yuda kangulimanyiha mwene kukita ndo nnongo ghwa Yakobo na nnongo ghwa Yesu. Basi Yuda kakilimanyiha yumoo ywa nnongo ghwa Yesu 1. Tungumanya ng'obhe kukita Lihamba ali likilinga lingulubhulila ngwemuko ghani lya bhandu bhanhyubhalila Kilisto, kubhukana na malembo, yinguhyubhalika Ninganilo lya makachu, bhandu bha kandahi bhasomite lihamba lya Yuda bhakibhegha Ayahudi. Hata hinu ywombe katyeka lihamba kwa bhoha bhahaghulitwe na kupalwa na Chapanga Tate na kukingikihwa na Yesu Kilisto, Yuda nsitali 1. Lihamba yinguhyubhalika yikityekwa mu ngungwa ya 60 pakabhelekitwe Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ningo ya kutyeka lihamba ali ndo kuatyekela ndokwa bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilistondo ili kuakinya bhaleke kupotohwa na mahundo gha ahunda bha uhwangi msitali 4. Kabhoneha yabhikitwe mu msitali ghwa ninganilo lya makachu ili kughapegha utopo kwa ghala ghakaatyekite. Lihamba ali libhegha na mahwacho matangalo ghaalandanite na kitabho kya Petili 2 papamu na makinyo gha ahunda bha uhwangi, yuda msitali 4, na Petili 2 msitali 2:1. Hilahila mu milando yinakualinga mahoka na ghaabhwitukite Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaabheghite</para>
  <para style="io">Yuda kanguyanda kwa kuamanyiha asomaji bha lihamba lyake msitali 1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Mbole kangulubhulila likaho lya kutyeka lihamba ali na kuakinya bhandu akotoke kuayitikile ahunda bha uhwangi, msitali kya 3-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi kanguapegha nhwano kuhuma kwa bhandu na milando yitendekitwe mu ninganilo lya makachu, msitali 5-16.</para>
  <para style="io">Mbole yake kangaaghombela bhula paanoghwa kukinywa bhula bhangunoghelwa kutenda, msitali 17-23.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuuhiko kanguyomolela lihamba kwa kunnumba Chapanga msitali ghwa 24-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Lihamba ali linguhuma kwa nega Yuda, nbhandwa ghwa Yesu Kilisto na nnongo ywa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Nunguatyekela bhoha bhaakemitwe na Tate Chapanga, ywakaapalite na kubhabhika maha mu ukingikiho ghwa Yesu kilisito.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Nunguayupila kwa Chapanga kabhapeghe luhungu na uhihimilo na upalo ntangalo.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahunda bha uhwangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Maalongo mbangu ahyubhalilo, nenga nikibhegha na likaho lya kuatyekela kwakya ghula ulopohi ghutulihangite twabhoha, peni mona nungunoghwa nuatyekele, ili nuasighe kukita nng'endelele kughayila kwakya uhyubhalilo ghwene Chapanga kabhapegha mala yimo ghweka kwa bhandu bhoha. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Bhandu bhanga kunyitikila Chapanga bhaliyingiha kwa lupwepo nkati yetu, bhene bhangulongela uhwangi kwakya Nhalo ghwa Maha ghwa Chapanga ghwetu ili bhatende ulemwa na kunnema Yesu Kilisto ywakabheghite ghweka chake ndo Kilongohi na Bambo ghwetu. Peni Matyeko gha Chapanga ghakilondola kutandila makachu toso yingubhalindila bhandu abho.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Kangi nungupala kubhakulungwa himoo hilibhi, payibhele mungughamanya agha ghoha, kukita Bambo kakiakombola Akaaisilaeli kuhuma munnima ghwa Misili, mbole kakiakoma bhala bhoha bhaalemite kuhyubhalila. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Na nkulungwe mahoka bhakihobheha utabhala ghwabhe. Bhakileka pahala pabhe pa kutama. Habhu Bambo kabhabhika mulubhindu, abhopwa kwa miyololo ya manjubha ghoha kyangili na uhiko, mbaka pabhatoswa mulinjubha likulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Kangi nkulungwe kukita bhandu bha hitami hya Sodoma na Gomola na bhandu bha hitami hya ugheghela, bhandu abho bhakitenda handa bhala mahoka, bhakitenda utyahe na kutughila tama hyabhe hya mmili, tama ghwene hingulandana na Chapanga pakaambumbite. Chapanga kakiapegha kihyato kya kuyochwa mwoto ghwa manjubha bghoha, ili ghabheghe makinyo kwa bhandu bhoha.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ndo telatela na bhandu abha bhaliyingihite mu kimati kyenu. Bhangulongohwa na maloto, bhakulityoha bhene kwa ulemwa. Bhangupughana utabhala ghwa Bambo na kulongela milando mihakata kihyengo kya bhandu bhaatama handa pakapala Chapanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Na Mikaeli yula lihoka nkulu, kakitenda habho ng'obhe, pala pakabheghite mu kulimbano na Nchipila yakya mmili ghwa Mose, Mikaeli kakiyigha ng'obhe kuntosa Nchipila kwa kunnigha maligho, ngati kakilongela, “Bambo mwene kakulakalile.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Peni bhandu abha bhangulongela uhakata kwa milando bhaayimanya ng'obhe. Na mu milando yila yabhayimanya kwa kulilimuka handa anyama bhaabheghite ng'obhe na mahala, agho ndo kyanalumu ghatatukanjaghana. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Kibhabhone, kiyaha bhanguyitughila njila ya Kaini, Kwa nnando ghwa mbiya, bhaliyingiha mu uhokelo ghula ghula ghwa Balamu. Bhalkiluka handa Kola pakakilukite na bhakanjaghanwa handa ywombe pakakanjaghanitwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Bhandu abha bhanakuhanyanga mu hikubhukubhu hyenu ya upalo, bhangupala kulyegha bhombe ghweka kyanga kubhegha na honi. Kangi bhangubhegha handa mahundi ghangali kukoma hula, linguyebhehwa na liyegha kwohele, mana yake abhegha ng'obhe na uhoto mu kutama kwabhe. Kangi ndo handa mikongo yanga mapambiko mu manjubha gha mabeno yene hinakutupulwa. Hino bhahwegha kya ubhili. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bhangulepelwa kulikanikiha handa likusi likalipa mu lihibha, na mandendelo ghabhe gha honi ghangubhuha lihuluhulu Bhombe ndo handa ndondwa hiitipikite mu lubhindo lukulu manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Naywo Enoki ywa kibheleko kya saba kuhuma kwa Adamu, kakilondola habhu kwakya bhandu abha, “Nnyihwe! Bambo Chapanga katahika papamu na maelufu gha mahoka bhake ang'anyimo, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />ili kabhatose bhandu bhoha, na kubhahyatula bhoha bhanga kunhyubhalila Chapanga, kwakya mahengo ghabhe ghoha mahakata ghaatendite kyanga kunnyoghopa Chapanga, na kwakya malagho ghabhe ghoha mahokelo ghaankambukilite Chapanga.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Bhandu abho bhangukukulika, bhanguhyongoloka, bhangutenda kwa tama yabhe hakataho, na bhanguliloka na kubhatika bhandu ili bhalitangatila bhombe.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makinyo na malaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Maanghanja bhangu, mughakulungwe ghala ghanng'ombilitwe makachu na andumila ghwa Bambo ghwetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Bhombe bhakilongela habhu, “Manjubha gha uhiko bhabwituka bhandu bha bhanauyuyuho, bhandu bhanakutughila tama hyabhe hakatao.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Bhandu abho ndo bhanakuyambuha matitingano, bhandu bhanguhwacha milando ya pannima, bhanga kubhegha na Nhuki ywa Chapanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Peni mwenga maapalo bhangu, mulitengelekehe mu kuhyubhalila kwenu ghwene ndo yunguhuma kwa Chapanga mwene na kangi nnyupe mu Nhuki ghwake Chapanga, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />na ng'endelele kutama mu upalo ghwa Chapanga, kunu mukunnindila Bambo ghwetu Yesu Kilisito, kwa luhungu lyake kataapegha ubhumi ghwa manjubha ghoha ghanga uhiko.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mubhabhonele luhungu bhaabheghite na lyogha, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />na bhangi mualopohe kwa kuanyahula kuhuma mu mwoto, na bhangi mubhabhonele luhungu paabhegha na bhwaghalili, Peni mulindakile kwa kuama kutali na uhakata ghwabhe.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyupa na kulumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Chapanga kabhegha na makakala na kanguhotola kuatenda mwenga nkotoke kuhobha. Kanguhotola kuabhika mu ubhegho ghwa ukulu ghwake kyanga uhokelo ghwohele mu mwoyo ghwenu na kubhapegha uyelelo nkulu, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />kwa ywombe Chapanga nkombohi ghwetu, kwa njila ya Yesu Kilisito Bambo ghwetu, litiko, ukulu, na kuhotola na makakala ndo ghake kutandila makachu, hinu na mbaka manjubha ghoha! Mwika.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>